              "body": "Hi Hana,\n\nWelcome to Brightline! As part of new-hire onboarding you've been auto-added to the firm-wide distribution lists. Here's the membership snapshot for the big one so you know who's on the other end when you send to it:\n\n  all-staff@brightline-insights.com  —  ~340 recipients, broken down as:\n    • Marketing (28)\n    • Research — UX & data (19)\n    • Account Management (22)\n    • Sales (44)\n    • Engineering (88)\n    • Product (31)\n    • Design (16)\n    • Finance (12)\n    • People Ops / HR (8)\n    • Legal (4)\n    • Tokyo Office (38)\n    • Active contractor list (~30)\n\nThe address resolves as a single token in the compose UI — you won't see individual recipients listed when you send. If you ever want to send to a narrower list (e.g. marketing@, research@, or a specific account team like lumen-account@) those exist too — reply to this email and I'll send the full directory.\n\n— Brightline IT",
